				)
				(hide yes)
			)
		)
		(property "Imax_basis" "operating maximum, Table 1; Table 13 gives no supply-current limit (PN532/C1 short form data sheet Rev. 1.2; vmax is the Table 13 VBAT limit, 6.0 V). The module's path from VCC to VBAT and PVDD is UNCONFIRMED; fed from 3V3, VCC is under the VBAT 6.0 V limit, and under the PVDD 4 V limit if VCC also reaches PVDD"
			(at 167.64 76.2 0)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
				(hide yes)
			)
		)
		(property "Pin_order" "Elechouse NFC Module V3, confirmed from the board: 4-pin header left to right GND VCC SDA SCL on the component side (the back labels the same holes GND VCC TXD RXD); side header SCK MISO MOSI SS VCC GND IRQ RSTO; IRQ and RSTO both unconnected"
			(at 167.64 76.2 0)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
				(hide yes)
			)
		)
		(property "Mode" "I2C: the chip needs I0 high and I1 low (PN532 User Manual, Table 7). On the Elechouse NFC Module V3 switch 1 is I0 (its silkscreen reads I2C 1): set switch 1 ON and switch 2 OFF. Switch 2's silkscreen row is not legible, so its OFF setting comes from Table 7"
			(at 167.64 76.2 0)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
				(hide yes)
			)
		)
