					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
		(property "Pin_order" "EC11: A C B on the three-pin side, switch S1 S2 on the two-pin side (the usual EC11 layout). Bare encoder with a separate push switch: A to GPIO 3, B to GPIO 4, common C to GND, switch S1 to GPIO 1 and S2 to 3V3. A stock KY-040 module ties its switch to its GND pin, which this firmware (switch to 3V3, internal pull-down) cannot read"
			(at 45.72 104.14 0)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
				(hide yes)
			)
		)
		(property "Type" "EC11 rotary encoder with push switch, 5 pins, switch legs separate from the common, wired switch-to-3V3"
