	(text "Printer station. Firmware: reader/src/main.cpp (filament-kit).\nPower: the C3's USB 5 V; every module on the C3's 3V3 pin; the buzzer on its 5V pin.\nI2C: Elechouse NFC Module V3 PN532 (0x24, switch 1 ON, switch 2 OFF) and OLED (0x3C) share SDA/SCL.\nPN532 IRQ and RSTO stay unconnected (firmware polls over I2C).\nEncoder: A/B to GPIO 3/4 with internal pull-ups, common C to GND;\npush switch S1-S2 between GPIO 1 and 3V3, internal pull-down.\nBuzzer: 12085 magnetic, 42 ohm, on 5 V; BS170 Q1 low side, 220 ohm gate RG1, 100k pull-down RP1,\n1N4001 flyback D1. GPIO 0 high = on, idles low.\nUNCONFIRMED: PN532 supply pin.\nBoard: U1 plugs into two 1x8 female headers. Off-board modules plug into JST-XH headers:\nJ1 PN532 and J2 OLED (GND 3V3 SDA SCL), J3 encoder (A B C SW 3V3), J4 buzzer (5V BZ-).\nU2, U3, SW1 and BZ1 are off the board (not placed on the PCB)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 152.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "cbb6bcc3-ee52-4fd1-b96e-3029c0f937c9")
	)
